chore: Makefile for easy generate command;

running `make generate` will generate the dart code, build
json-serializable code and format everything.

chore: generate api endpoints provider code;

generated by running `python openapi-to-dart.py` in the project root.
Additionally, the command `dart format lib/provider/generated/` was run.

feat: first impl. of provider generating;

similarly to the schema generation, we use the python script to generate
providers and methods for every endpoint of the backend API

fix: double tap on marker zooms on map;

usually, double taps are never meant for the map markers, thats why the
event is propagated to the underlying map.

feat: change size of focused marker;

to not rebuild all markers when on is focussed, the new (and possibly)
old markers are replaced with their updated versions.

feat: add submodule `shared`;

this is going to be used for information shared between frontend and
backend.
